(text "Shared link: pin 18 to pin 23, 10 pF (E2B-54-1953 §4.3.3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 24.13 102.87 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "baf2028e-d2eb-53d8-92a7-7bcf9a6f7878"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: both RF paths as Murata's copy (0603 positions, LQP03 / GRM03 class): ANT0 to the\n   U.FL of the Molex 146153-0050 (fitted), ANT1 to a second U.FL (not fitted) (ADR 0018).\n2. Absent state: passive. Shared configuration: series 0 Ω on ANT0 fitted, shunts DNP; the 10 pF\n   link from BT_15.4_IN to ANT1 fitted; the ANT1 path not fitted.\n3. Dedicated configuration: fit the ANT1 path and terminate BT_15.4_IN per E2B-09-1413 Figure 10\n   (values UNVERIFIED as drawn) instead of the 10 pF link; calibration file per ADR 0018 item 6.\n4. RF microstrip 50 Ω, 7-25 mm, ground 230-240 µm below (Murata); ≥ 0.8 mm keep-out under each U.FL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 228.6 0) (size 129.54 20.32) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "519577bd-27df-5cb2-bff5-1c28e3606911"))
